1
00:01:08,750 --> 00:01:12,910
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:15,789
[Episode 14]

3
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:22,590
Are you going to the Spotlight Bar?

4
00:01:22,590 --> 00:01:23,310
What about it?

5
00:01:23,310 --> 00:01:25,910
You have no idea
what that place is really like.

6
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:28,870
If you go rashly,
you'll definitely be in danger.

7
00:01:28,870 --> 00:01:29,430
The Spotlight Bar

8
00:01:29,430 --> 00:01:31,039
is seemingly run by Zhao Fang,

9
00:01:31,039 --> 00:01:33,070
but it's actually controlled by Zhao Xiao.

10
00:01:33,070 --> 00:01:34,120
So I must go and get more

11
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,400
evidence against Zhao Xiao.

12
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,000
Xu Jing,

13
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:38,440
I know you're eager for revenge.

14
00:01:39,310 --> 00:01:39,920
But,

15
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:42,590
you must at least ensure your own safety.

16
00:01:42,590 --> 00:01:43,229
Dr. Fang,

17
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:45,660
I really appreciate your concern,

18
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:47,580
but you're crossing the line.

19
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:52,250
Do you know why I insist on helping you?

20
00:02:02,710 --> 00:02:04,640
Let me tell you!

21
00:02:05,350 --> 00:02:06,350
I told you not

22
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:07,900
to wear that dress!

23
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:08,889
But you had to!

24
00:02:09,710 --> 00:02:10,729
How dare you hide?

25
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,250
Still trying to hide?

26
00:02:14,190 --> 00:02:14,920
Keep hiding!

27
00:02:15,310 --> 00:02:16,040
Keep hiding!

28
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,800
Will you listen to me now?

29
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:19,130
How dare you run around?

30
00:02:20,030 --> 00:02:20,850
How dare you?

31
00:02:21,010 --> 00:02:22,210
Still trying to hide?

32
00:02:22,750 --> 00:02:23,880
You dare fight back?

33
00:02:24,030 --> 00:02:25,360
How dare you fight back!

34
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,520
Mom.

35
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:51,410
When I stopped the scalpel
in the operating room,

36
00:02:52,310 --> 00:02:53,900
it was because my cowardice

37
00:02:55,710 --> 00:02:58,000
once hurt the person who loved me most.

38
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,870
I failed to protect my mother.

39
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:07,640
If I hadn't closed the door back then...

40
00:03:08,430 --> 00:03:10,260
I could never forgive myself.

41
00:03:11,430 --> 00:03:12,900
That was my mother.

42
00:03:13,150 --> 00:03:13,710
But...

43
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:18,930
I didn't even
have the courage to protect her.

44
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:42,960
Your mother didn't get hurt
because of you.

45
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:46,079
Instead, she protected you.

46
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:48,840
You were so young back then.

47
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,980
How could you fight
against the whole world?

48
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:54,360
And I don't think

49
00:03:54,870 --> 00:03:57,329
your mother would
want you to keep suffering

50
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:59,020
over what happened to her.

51
00:04:05,310 --> 00:04:06,640
I really appreciate you

52
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:09,650
trying so hard to find me
for your surgery.

53
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,400
You gave me a chance

54
00:04:12,030 --> 00:04:13,310
to face the coward

55
00:04:13,310 --> 00:04:14,520
I used to be.

56
00:04:16,510 --> 00:04:19,570
Even if all I can do
is stand by your side and support you,

57
00:04:20,630 --> 00:04:22,630
I feel like I've finally pushed open

58
00:04:23,750 --> 00:04:25,350
that door from my childhood.

59
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:27,800
Xu Jing.

60
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:31,720
I never meant to stop you
from getting revenge.

61
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,920
Believe me or not,

62
00:04:35,190 --> 00:04:36,390
I want you to finish

63
00:04:36,390 --> 00:04:38,310
what you set out to do more than anyone.

64
00:04:38,310 --> 00:04:39,040
I'm just...

65
00:04:40,830 --> 00:04:42,360
I'm just worried about you.

66
00:04:53,510 --> 00:04:54,640
Let's go together.

67
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,060
Let's go help them.

68
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:06,040
The first floor is for regular customers.

69
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,700
Only members can go upstairs.

70
00:05:07,830 --> 00:05:10,500
They told me if I don't have money,
I can't get up there—

71
00:05:10,500 --> 00:05:12,150
unless I'm pretty enough.

72
00:05:12,510 --> 00:05:14,170
Why do you want to go upstairs?

73
00:05:14,390 --> 00:05:17,680
My classmate told me
I could make a lot of money upstairs.

74
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:20,920
They said everyone
above the second floor is rich.

75
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,160
As long as someone picks you,

76
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:24,360
you can become an influencer or a star.

77
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,880
Hello, you can't enter here.

78
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,510
I'm sorry.

79
00:06:05,410 --> 00:06:07,260
[Wednesday, June 25, 2025]

80
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:15,540
[Wednesday, June 25, 2025]

81
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:09,270
I have a VIP room upstairs.

82
00:07:09,300 --> 00:07:10,520
Wanna come with me?

83
00:07:10,990 --> 00:07:11,700
What?

84
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,350
A VIP room.

85
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,400
Coming or not?

86
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:25,240
So that's why you want to go upstairs?

87
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:27,510
I'm different from the others.

88
00:07:27,510 --> 00:07:29,920
Someone upstairs
already has their eye on me.

89
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:32,000
I just need to be a little prettier.

90
00:07:38,630 --> 00:07:42,240
You think they're only
interested in your face?

91
00:07:42,430 --> 00:07:44,000
Do you think once you go upstairs,

92
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,920
they'll just put you on display?

93
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,159
Being chosen by them

94
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:50,510
is not a reward.

95
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:53,510
There's no free lunch in this world.

96
00:07:53,930 --> 00:07:56,360
You're handing your fate over to them.

97
00:07:57,190 --> 00:07:59,050
Have you thought about the price?

98
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,650
Hello, Mr. Zhao.

99
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,440
Hello, I'm Zhao Fang.

100
00:08:43,789 --> 00:08:45,190
May I ask your name?

101
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:46,870
Amy.

102
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,960
Have we met before?

103
00:08:49,270 --> 00:08:50,840
Is this your first time here?

104
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,480
I've been here with a friend before.

105
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:55,810
I heard everyone
in our industry comes here.

106
00:08:56,630 --> 00:08:57,770
Let me guess.

107
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:01,870
A woman as beautiful and elegant as you

108
00:09:02,790 --> 00:09:04,630
must be a new artist signed

109
00:09:04,630 --> 00:09:06,180
by some agency, right?

110
00:09:06,790 --> 00:09:07,990
I'm not an actress.

111
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,480
But you're close.

112
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:11,120
I'm an agent.

113
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,780
But I just started

114
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:14,530
and don't have many resources.

115
00:09:14,910 --> 00:09:16,670
Then you've come to the right place.

116
00:09:16,670 --> 00:09:19,670
Resources are the one thing
we're never short of here.

117
00:09:21,510 --> 00:09:23,790
See those rooms?

118
00:09:25,090 --> 00:09:26,690
Do you know what they're for?

119
00:09:30,660 --> 00:09:34,780
[Wednesday, June 25, 2025]

120
00:09:30,910 --> 00:09:32,830
Just a tiny room of a few square meters—

121
00:09:32,830 --> 00:09:34,610
but everyone going in and out

122
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:37,800
is someone you'd never
cross paths with in your whole life.

123
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:38,650
Mr. Zhao.

124
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:41,090
This isn't really appropriate.

125
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,810
Stop playing innocent with me.

126
00:09:44,270 --> 00:09:46,720
Why are you still acting like a pure girl
when you're here?

127
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,990
Mr. Zhao, this is really inappropriate.

128
00:09:48,940 --> 00:09:51,540
[Wednesday, June 25, 2025]

129
00:09:49,020 --> 00:09:50,790
Isn't this exactly
what you want? Resources?

130
00:09:50,790 --> 00:09:52,910
I promise, if you get with me,

131
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:55,430
you'll have unlimited access
to resources on this floor.

132
00:09:55,430 --> 00:09:57,120
Mr. Zhao, this is really inappropriate.

133
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:59,600
-People outside will see.
-Good. Let them see.

134
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:00,220
Let go.

135
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:00,910
Boss.

136
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:05,600
Boss, Mr. Cui wants you
to pick a bottle of wine.

137
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,700
His new girlfriend just got here.

138
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:11,080
Can't you see I'm busy here?

139
00:10:11,670 --> 00:10:12,150
Get out!

140
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:13,150
Yes.

141
00:10:15,270 --> 00:10:16,070
Mr. Zhao.

142
00:10:37,910 --> 00:10:39,710
I put you in charge of this place,

143
00:10:40,510 --> 00:10:42,110
and this is how you manage it?

144
00:10:45,390 --> 00:10:47,520
Are those rooms for just anyone to see?

145
00:10:50,830 --> 00:10:53,160
And letting Mr. Cui play around like that,

146
00:10:53,170 --> 00:10:54,540
can you afford to offend

147
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:55,940
his wife, Ms. Qin?

148
00:11:06,670 --> 00:11:07,240
Boss.

149
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,170
Are you alright?

150
00:11:09,780 --> 00:11:11,150
Don't let Mr. Zhao know.

151
00:11:20,510 --> 00:11:22,100
I built this place

152
00:11:22,510 --> 00:11:24,780
by kissing asses out there.

153
00:11:24,810 --> 00:11:27,490
I can smash it however I want!
